# Port 80 Enumeration

Directory enumeration was performed using Gobuster.

```bash
gobuster dir -u http://<TARGET_IP>/ \
-w /usr/share/wordlists/dirb/common.txt
```

Discovered directory:

```
/hidden
```

Continue enumeration.

```bash
gobuster dir -u http://<TARGET_IP>/hidden/ \
-w /usr/share/wordlists/dirb/common.txt
```

Discovered:

```
/whatever
```

Viewing the page source revealed a Base64 encoded string.

Decode it using:

```bash
echo "<BASE64_STRING>" | base64 -d
```

Successfully recovered **Flag 1**.

