# Hash Cracking

Save the hash.

```bash
echo "<GOST_HASH>" > hash.txt
```

Crack the hash using John the Ripper.

```bash
john --wordlist=easypeasy.txt \
--format=gost hash.txt
```

Display the recovered password.

```bash
john --show hash.txt
```

Recovered passphrase:

```
mypasswordforthatjob
```

