# Steganography

Extract the hidden content from the image.

```bash
steghide extract -sf binarycodepixabay.jpg
```

Enter the recovered passphrase:

```
mypasswordforthatjob
```

A file named:

```
secrettext.txt
```

is extracted.

Contents:

```
username: boring
password: <binary>
```

The password is stored as binary and must be converted into plain text.

Recovered credentials:

```
Username: boring
Password: iconvertedmypasswordtobinary
```

