# User Enumeration

List files.

```bash
ls -la
```

Read the user flag.

```bash
cat user.txt
```

The flag is encoded using **ROT13**.

Decode using:

```bash
echo "<ROT13_TEXT>" | tr 'A-Za-z' 'N-ZA-Mn-za-m'
```

Recovered the User Flag.

