# Key Takeaways

- Always perform a full TCP port scan.
- Enumerate every exposed web service independently.
- Never ignore page source or robots.txt.
- Identify encoding before decoding.
- Identify hash type before attempting to crack it.
- Images may contain hidden information.
- Enumerate cron jobs after obtaining shell access.
- Writable scripts executed by root can lead to full system compromise.

